File Index

/chat-probe.ts
Purpose: Identifies and parses chat message quotes in text buffers for efficient chat detection and extraction.

/chat-settings-store.ts
Purpose: Manages and persists user chat pane settings and preferences.

/chat-store.ts
Purpose: Manages and distributes real-time chat messages with ANSI color support.

/dsl-to-ansi.ts
Purpose: Maps DSL color codes to ANSI escape sequences for terminal text formatting.

/strict-chat-classifier.ts
Purpose: Classifies raw chat input into structured subtypes for consistent handling.
